[{"answer":"Come in... come in. It's Miss Wallace, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right. How do you do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/2.mp3"},{"answer":"How do you do? Please take a seat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I've got your application form here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I just want to check the information... is that all right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, you're 28, aren't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I am.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/9.mp3"},{"answer":"And you aren't married, are you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/10.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I'm not... yet; I'm engaged.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh, huh. You didn't go to university?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/12.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I didn't, but I went to technical college.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/13.mp3"},{"answer":"And I started work when I was 20.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I see. You can speak Spanish, can't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I can... but I can write it better than I can speak it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there any other language you can speak?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I can speak a little French.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/18.mp3"},{"answer":"You've been to Argentina, haven't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I have... and to France.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/20.mp3"},{"answer":"So I see... but you haven't been to the Middle East, have you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/21.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I'm afraid I haven't, but I'd like to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Good, because there is a demand for multi-lingual people in this job.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I think you will do just fine!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you so much! I won't disappoint you!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/90-applying-for-a-job-2022-03-07-21-35-19/25.mp3"}]
